{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49538","headline":"菩萨蛮 二 · 尹鹗","name":"菩萨蛮 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"呜呜晓角调如语，画楼三会喧雷鼓。\n枕上梦方残，月光铺水寒。\n蛾眉应歛翠，咫尺同千里。\n宿酒未全消，满怀离恨饶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尹鹗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49538.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49538","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}